00:30:38,953 --> 00:30:40,783
Eventually, pattern starts to emerge.

533
00:30:40,893 --> 00:30:44,843
Maybe network timing issues account for
a significant percentage of failures.

534
00:30:45,553 --> 00:30:49,553
Maybe certain ser-services
consistently generating a

